 in westminster since saturday  well yes i'm having conversations with  other members of parliament  you know in labor and the conservatives  there's a lot of unhappy  mps who feel that their parties have  deserted them  people are looking at the lib dem  conference where sam and  chukka and luciana are receiving such a  warm welcome  they say they feel at home that it is  the right decision  and i think there's other mps that are  are looking at that with a great deal of  interest he's going to be pulling  someone else  out of your hat this week many of these  things take time but i'm certainly  optimistic that the liberal democrats  will continue to grow  great thank you very much thank you

